// Coverage: alto and tenor C-clefs (the C-clef sits on a different line in each,
// so notes and the clef glyph land at different staff positions). Guards the
// per-clef staff-position cases in CalculateStaffPosition.
title "Alto and tenor clefs"
time 4/4
key f major
part alt { clef alto }
part ten { clef tenor }
section Main {
  alt { c4 d e f | g a bes c | }
  ten { c4 d e f | g a bes c | }
}
structure { Main }
render score "alto-tenor-clefs.svg" { staff { alt } staff { ten } }
